// SYNTAX TEST "source.nota" "at-forms: sigil + name only; props/body left UNPAINTED; colon-sugar; interpolation"

// --- host element head: sigil + host tag name; a nested element + interpolation; the body braces are NOT claimed ---
A host @p{Hello @em{w} and @name here.}
//     ^ punctuation.definition.tag.nota
//      ^ entity.name.tag.html.nota
//              ^ punctuation.definition.tag.nota
//               ^^ entity.name.tag.html.nota
//                         ^ punctuation.definition.interpolation.nota
//                          ^^^^ variable.other.interpolation.nota

// --- component head + NEGATIVE: the whole [props]{body} tail stays plain source.nota ---
// (never-lie: never enter props -- not embedded TS, not a tag; markup-valued props cannot derail this grammar) ---
A block @Aside[variant: "tip", n: 1]{Body} tail.
//      ^ punctuation.definition.tag.nota
//       ^^^^^ support.class.component.nota
//            ^ source.nota - source.ts
//             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.nota - entity.name.tag.html.nota

// --- another host + props: interior is unpainted (not embedded TS, not interpolation) ---
A link @a[href: "/x"]{link} text.
//     ^ punctuation.definition.tag.nota
//      ^ entity.name.tag.html.nota
//       ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.nota - source.ts

// --- colon-sugar at line start (indented here so the name is column-assertable): tag + colon sigil ---
  @summary: colon body here
//^ punctuation.definition.tag.nota
// ^^^^^^^ entity.name.tag.html.nota
//        ^ keyword.operator.colon-sugar.nota
  @Cap: component colon body
//^ punctuation.definition.tag.nota
// ^^^ support.class.component.nota
//    ^ keyword.operator.colon-sugar.nota

// --- NEGATIVE: a mid-line name-colon is a bare interpolation, NOT colon-sugar (the colon stays literal) ---
text @user: not sugar here
//   ^ punctuation.definition.interpolation.nota
//    ^^^^ variable.other.interpolation.nota
//        ^ source.nota - keyword.operator.colon-sugar.nota

// --- bare capitalised / lowercase names (no trigger) are interpolation, NOT tags ---
A bare @Name and @name interpolate.
//     ^ punctuation.definition.interpolation.nota
//      ^^^^ variable.other.interpolation.nota
//      ^^^^ source.nota - support.class.component.nota
//               ^ punctuation.definition.interpolation.nota
//                ^^^^ variable.other.interpolation.nota
